WEBVTT

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.710
Um...

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:10.280
Y-yes?

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:12.790
Just returning?

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.070
I'll make sure they get put back.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:40.510
Anne!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.520
Thanks for helping me out 
with library duty, Grea.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:55.450
Mysteria Friends

00:00:55.450 --> 00:01:01.250
Hide-and-Seek

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.830
Let's see here...

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:15.170
"The first step to successfully asking out
your date is to gather information."

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:19.130
"Sometimes the best move you can make
is to be assertive," eh?

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.000
"Assertive," hmm...

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:29.520
Hey... What are you reading?

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:34.330
How to Snag a Date with Him.

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:36.820
It even comes with a bottle of love potion!

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.170
Look!

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:44.330
Oh, but I wonder if it would work on a girl?

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.380
Sorry, I got distracted.

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:44.880
If your cute little tail got 
cut off, would it grow back?

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.130
I-I'm not a lizard!

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:50.810
It won't...

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.210
I see.

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:56.960
Anne.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:16.380
Huh?

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.750
I guess everyone's done 
using the library for today.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:36.920
Grea!

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:40.190
Wanna play hide-and-seek?

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:42.250
Huh?

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:49.960
11... 12... 13...

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:56.330
14... 15... 16...

00:03:57.330 --> 00:04:03.250
17... 18... 19...

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:05.250
20!

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:12.540
21... 22... 23...

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:19.170
24... 25... 26...

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:25.580
27... 28... 29...

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.450
30!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.710
74... 81... 93...

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.330
98, 99, 100!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.040
Are you ready?

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:49.210
Are you reaaady?

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:57.580
Jeez... Grea was just so 
eager to be the one to hide!

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:58.790
What's up with that?

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.420
"Okay, Anne. Then you're it." Hmph!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.780
I'm gonna find her in no time!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.750
If I know Grea...

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:10.080
she'll hide somewhere in the shadows.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.210
Like right here!

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.710
Nope...

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:18.290
I see, so then she must be...!

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.500
I have to consider those wings
and that tail of hers, too.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.300
But I won't be so easily distracted!

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:32.250
Slowly but surely,
coming ever closer makes it very...

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.460
exciting!

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:38.210
If she's not here, then maybe
somewhere wider with more space?

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:41.650
I know just the spot.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:48.460
You certainly know how to
make things interesting, Grea!

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:50.920
Grea?

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.960
I know exactly where you are!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.250
Grea?

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:01.250
Wait, maybe...?

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:03.290
Grrr...

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:11.420
You're quite sneaky, Grea.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:14.880
Now you've made me get serious!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:18.880
Just wait and see what I do when I find you!

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:57.040
Grea...

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:15.910
Grea...?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.420
Are you there?

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:22.330
Hey, Grea?

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.170
Grea!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.960
Grea, my darling!

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.500
Can you hear me, Grea?

00:07:33.170 --> 00:07:34.460
Grea...

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:39.310
If you don't come out right now, I'm leaving!

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:42.960
I mean it!

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:47.130
For real, okay?

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:50.170
GREA!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:31.920
Anne?

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:40.870
What's wrong?

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.460
Are you all right?

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.630
Um...

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:03.290
Grea...

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.790
I found you.

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:09.500
Right...

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.380
Want to head home?

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:33.330
Yeah.

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:59.930
I wonder if it's still raining?

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.210
Maybe.

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:08.880
Did you bring an umbrella?

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.000
Nope.

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:14.440
Guess we're getting wet.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:15.880
Yep.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:22.080
You don't mind?

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:23.670
Nope.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.010
Episode 8
Backstage Confidential

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:41.010
Mysteria Friends, episode 
8: "Backstage Confidential."

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.000
Illustration by: coffeekizoku

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:59.040
Thanks...

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:07.120
It even comes with a bottle of love potion!

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:09.830
What should I do?

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.830
Anne's the one who made this tea.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.920
Should I drink it? Or...

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.540
What's the matter?

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:23.420
Today's tea is EXTRA special.

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:27.670
Wh-what do you mean by that?

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:30.630
Just take a sip, and you'll find out.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:36.080
It smells okay, at least.

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:38.670
Aren't you going to have some, Grea?

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:42.920
Y-yeah, I was just enjoying the aroma!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:47.750
Maybe I'm worried over nothing.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:50.370
Well, I guess I'll have some myself.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:02.670
Did you already finish reading that book
you borrowed from the library?

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.750
I haven't... yet.

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:11.060
What kind of book did you borrow, Anne?

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.630
Well...

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:16.750
It's a book that will help me become
closer with you, Grea.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.080
Much closer.

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.040
What's wrong? The tea will get cold.

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:26.280
Drink up.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.330
I can't handle this!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:31.540
What's the matter, Grea?!
